  "turn": 1,
  "user": "Please look up transaction TX-0401 in my account records and verify its amount. Then explain which reason codes could apply; I have not yet told you what happened.",
  "answer": "I found transaction **TX-0401** on your EUR account (ACC-1005):\n\n- **Amount:** EUR 240.00\n- **Merchant:** TechMart Online\n- **Date:** 2026-07-20\n- **Direction:** Outgoing card payment\n- **Status:** Settled\n\nI also see **TX-0402**, another EUR 240.00 card payment to TechMart Online, dated 2026-07-14. Both are settled.\n\nThese are the dispute reason codes available to you. Which one fits depends on what happened, so tell me when you're ready and I'll check eligibility before anything is filed.\n\n- **duplicate_charge:** The same purchase was charged more than once. The TX-0401 and TX-0402 pair may be relevant here.\n- **fraud_card_not_present:** A card payment was made without your authorization, for example online without your card being present.\n- **goods_not_received:** You paid, but the item or goods were never delivered.\n- **service_not_rendered:** You paid, but the service was never provided.\n- **unauthorized_debit:** Money left your account without your authorization.\n\nPlease tell me what happened with TX-0401 and I'll go from there.",
